RUMBLO (rumblo.rock): https://github.com/Techcrafter/RUMBLO commit
7e39a4c4fd048d6bd6ce973680666625bb6f69bd, by Techcrafter, LGPL-3.0 (see LICENSE;
the repo's art carries no separate license, so it is taken as LGPL-3.0 too).

The original is a 2000-line goto program on the CE graphx library. This is a
rewrite of its fight engine (game.c: arenas, speeds, jump, knockback and the
opponent's decision tree as in the original) and a view that samples the
320x240 tile artwork down to 128x96 (view.c). assets.c is generated by
gen_assets.py from the original gfx/ and tilemap/ files. Only single player
exists upstream (multiplayer is not implemented there either). No license
problems.
